&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Story&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At thinkcell, we create powerful software solutions that help professionals be more efficient and productive. Founded in 2002 and based in Berlin, our tools integrate seamlessly with Microsoft Office to help users create presentations, charts, and diagrams with ease. Our dynamic, international team values creativity, collaboration, and technical excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Working Student in our Academics team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will support the day-to-day operations and growth of thinkcell’s academic program. You will work on a broad range of tasks, from handling program requests and supporting outreach to coordinating workshops and improving processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our academic program gives students and professors free access to thinkcell and helps them develop practical skills in data visualization and storytelling. You will help us bring these opportunities to more universities, faculty members, and student clubs worldwide (find out more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.think-cell.com/en/order/academics&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;). We have big plans to grow the program significantly with the next years – and you can be apart of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support program operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Help manage our academic inbox, respond to student and faculty inquiries, and coordinate license requests, renewals, and extensions with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review new applications&lt;/strong&gt;: Research faculty members and institutions, assess eligibility against program guidelines, and prepare responses and next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support academic outreach&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify relevant professors and student clubs, draft personalized outreach, and follow up with existing contacts to build engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate workshops&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with student clubs and faculty to schedule workshops, organize logistics, and keep contact information up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute across the team&lt;/strong&gt;: Support ongoing projects and ad hoc tasks, taking ownership of defined activities as you gain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be great for this position if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Studies&lt;/strong&gt;: Currently enrolled in business, computer science, or a related field, with at least two years of university studies completed – undergraduate degree is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive and comfortable working independently, with strong problem-solving skills and a keen eye for detail. Well organized, reliable, and able to prioritize tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt;: Proficient in Microsoft Office, especially Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Availability &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Available for 20 hours per week, including at least two days per week at our headquarters in Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presentation experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience creating presentations in PowerPoint is a strong plus; familiarity with thinkcell is an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As part of our team, you will embody and help shape the following principles that define us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Forward Thinking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We embrace change and challenge the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We take pride in our work and learn from our mistakes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Customer First&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We prioritize delivering lasting value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unified Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We foster collaboration, respect, and integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strive for Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: We set ambitious goals and pursue quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe in a human hiring process, every application is personally reviewed.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why is thinkcell the right place for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We empower over 1.3 million users across 35,000 companies, including top consulting firms and major global enterprises. With offices in Berlin, Munich, Denver, Boston, London, Tokyo, and Dubai, we’re a diverse team of over 240 people, committed to innovation and excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;thinkcell is more than a job – it&#39;s a chance to be part of an innovative, inclusive team that values collaboration and growth. We encourage applicants from all backgrounds to apply. Together, we can shape the future of productivity software. We can’t wait to see what you’ll bring to the team!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Your mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager – Data Engineering &amp;amp; Machine Learning, you’ll lead Catawiki’s established team of Data Engineers and Machine Learning specialists. You’ll help the team grow, set its technical direction and build on work already underway across data foundations and production machine learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role spans two connected disciplines. You’ll bring deep experience in either Data Engineering or Machine Learning Engineering, and enough breadth to set direction across the other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner with Product, Engineering, Analytics and business stakeholders to set priorities and connect the team’s work to outcomes across Catawiki.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead the team through platform modernisation and product-facing ML work. Current priorities include modernising the infrastructure for serving production models, introducing a feature store to improve feature management and consistency across model training and serving, and strengthening observability and cost controls. You’ll help set priorities and raise the reliability and impact of this work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team:&lt;/strong&gt; Set direction, coach experienced specialists and create clear ownership across Data Engineering and Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build dependable data foundations:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve the pipelines, integrations and infrastructure the wider Data team relies on for analysis, reporting and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen production ML:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve deployment, monitoring and operational follow-through for production models, so teams can run them reliably and resolve issues effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance marketplace models:&lt;/strong&gt; Help teams improve recommendation, cancellation and bidder-risk use cases, connecting model performance to meaningful product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set direction and priorities:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Product, Engineering, Analytics and business partners to choose high-value problems and balance delivery, reliability and long-term platform health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the technology strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Reporting to the SVP Engineering, you’ll join the Engineering Management team and help shape the direction of the Technology department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You combine strong technical judgement with experienced people leadership. You create clarity in a complex environment, empower specialists and make sound decisions across both disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your experience will include the following. Familiarity with Catawiki’s current stack is useful, and equivalent experience with other platforms is welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical depth in one discipline:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience designing, building and operating data-intensive systems in Data Engineering or Machine Learning Engineering, with practical knowledge of the other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience leading experienced engineers or ML specialists, coaching their growth and setting clear expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture and systems thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to evaluate trade-offs and guide architecture for data platforms, distributed systems and production infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production ML understanding:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with the deployment, monitoring and operation of machine learning systems in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business and product judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to connect technical work to business goals, make priority calls and assess outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant cloud platform experience:&lt;/strong&gt; We run on GCP using BigQuery, Vertex AI and Kubernetes. Experience with equivalent AWS services is also relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Streaming and integration experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Kafka, event-driven systems or modern data integration tools are useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to explain technical trade-offs and align technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll lead a team of eight Data Engineers and Machine Learning specialists across Amsterdam and Lisbon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team works closely with Product, Engineering, Analytics and business stakeholders to connect data and ML capabilities to real needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specialists own implementation while you set direction, priorities and clear standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team supports production data and ML systems, and has no on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role in Amsterdam. You will work from our Amsterdam HQ a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muck Rack is trusted by thousands of organizations around the world to understand how their brands show up across news, social media and AI-generated answers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI-powered platform connects the entire PR workflow in one place, helping communications teams manage media relationships, understand the conversations shaping their brands, take action and measure their impact. Combined with analyst-led Media Intelligence and advisory services, Muck Rack turns signals into insights and insights into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founder-controlled and growing&amp;nbsp; profitably and sustainably, we have the freedom to build forward-thinking products, put our customers first, and offer an inclusive culture that welcomes diverse perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a collaborative, self-motivated &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Search &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you’ll help build and evolve the customer-facing search experiences that help users discover relevant, high-quality content, along with the backend systems that power them. You’ll work across the stack, with a slight emphasis on frontend development, and collaborate closely with engineers, Product, and Design to deliver intuitive search experiences backed by reliable, scalable search and data systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver customer-facing search features and workflows across frontend and backend systems, from technical planning through production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-powered product experiences end to end, from the services behind them to the interfaces that make their output useful and trustworthy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build intuitive, responsive user experiences using Vue while contributing to the Python and Django services that power them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and improve search, indexing, and retrieval systems that support high-quality content discovery across large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain features and data workflows that leverage technologies such as Elasticsearch, Kafka, Celery, and MySQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful technical decisions and trade-offs that balance customer experience, delivery speed, performance, reliability, and long-term maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design, and engineering teammates to shape solutions, clarify requirements, and deliver high-quality customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex production issues and drive improvements to the performance, reliability, observability, and maintainability of the systems you work on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an on-call and incident response rotation, helping diagnose and resolve production issues and improve system reliability over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Be Set Up for Success in This Role, You&#39;ll Need to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience building and maintaining production software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working across frontend and backend systems and independently delivering features throughout the application stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Python or a similar programming language and experience with Django or a comparable web framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building polished, maintainable user-facing applications with Vue.js or another modern JavaScript framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Elasticsearch or a comparable search technology, or significant experience working with data-intensive systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience making technical trade-offs within complex production systems while balancing immediate delivery needs with long-term quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience diagnosing production issues and contributing to the reliability and operational health of the systems you build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TypeScript in a large codebase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design systems or shared component libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to adjust working hours for overlap with teammates in US time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If Any of the Below Also Describe You, This Could Be an Exciting Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kafka or other streaming or event-driven technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MySQL, Postgres, or other relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Celery or other asynchronous task-processing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building search, discovery, indexing, or information-retrieval features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving frontend architecture, performance, or complex customer-facing workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-traffic SaaS applications or systems that process large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building customer-facing features backed by LLMs or other AI models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience judging whether an AI-backed feature is actually working, through evaluation, testing, or user feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in journalism, news, media, or social media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Addition, We&#39;re Always Looking for Candidates Who&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex technical ideas clearly and collaborate effectively with both technical and non-technical partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of problems and drive work forward independently while knowing when to involve others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in building readable, testable, maintainable software while making pragmatic technical trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach ambiguous or complex problems thoughtfully and use sound judgment to identify effective solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a strong engineering culture through thoughtful code reviews, knowledge sharing, feedback, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively incorporates AI tools into day-to-day work to improve productivity and accelerate delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Interview Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below you&#39;ll find an outline of the interview plan for this role. Please note that this is what we expect the process to look like; we may ask you for supplemental information or require an additional step before making a final decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 min interview with a member of our Talent Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1 hour zoom interview with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer interviews with several team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Bar Raiser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Team Engagement Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires up to 10% travel for team collaboration, customer engagements, and company events. As part of our commitment to building strong connections across our fully distributed team, attendance at our annual company offsite (typically held in Mexico) is expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;108&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in Ireland is €95,000–€110,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary for this role in Bulgaria is €6,000+ gross per month, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual compensation decisions are based on a number of factors, including experience level, skillset, and balancing internal equity relative to peers at the company. We expect the majority of the candidates who are offered roles at our company to fall healthily throughout the range based on these factors. We recognize that the person we hire may be less experienced (or more senior) than this job description as posted. If that ends up being the case, the updated salary range will be communicated with you as a candidate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Muck Rack?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Work, Forever&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully distributed team with a permanent remote setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend, phone and internet reimbursement, coworking membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual and in-person team bonding (lunches, events, competitions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent &amp;amp; Fair Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive geo-neutral pay in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual reviews to ensure equity and market alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardized bonus or commission structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with employer contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, vision, disability, and life insurance for employees and dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% premium coverage for individuals on high-deductible plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 Virtual Care and Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-funded HSA contributions and other pre-tax benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly wellness stipend and free Headspace subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Family Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;4+ weeks of PTO, plus paid sick and mental health days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;13 paid holidays with the option to swap for personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent pathways for internal mobility and promotion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-annual performance reviews, team workshops, and leadership training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited access to Coursera and O’Reilly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 additional PTO days annually for learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive, Customer-First Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to equity and valuing diverse perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile, founder-led company focused on collaboration and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by 3,000+ companies worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Benefits and compensation reflect offerings for U.S.-based employees. Support is provided for employees in other locations, in compliance with local laws and regulations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we are a fully distributed team, we do have limitations on where we can hire and maintain a list of acceptable working locations based on job function. If we are unable to hire in your current location for the role for which you applied, you will be notified via email. While we enjoy many benefits as a permanently distributed and remote company, we cannot always support relocation or extended travel and have guidelines in place to ensure compliant work away from your designated permanent residence.&lt;/p&gt;
