&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Talent Brand Manager, you&#39;ll shape how current and prospective team members understand what it means to work at GitLab. You&#39;ll bring our employer value proposition to life through talent brand strategy, recruitment marketing, and integrated campaigns across the candidate journey. You&#39;ll combine editorial judgment, performance data, cross-functional influence, and artificial intelligence tools to create clear, inclusive, and authentic candidate experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
